###Calculating the midline

According to the graph, the maximum value of the function is $-2.2$, and its minimum value is $-8.5$.

$\begin{align}\text{midline}&=\dfrac{\text{max value}+\text{min value}}{2}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{-2.2+(-8.5)}{2}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{-10.7}{2}
\\\\
&=-5.35
\end{align}$
